  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound sage flavored breakfast sausage",
    "3 cups shredded potatoes, drained and pressed",
    "0.25 cup butter, melted",
    "1 (16 ounce) container small curd cottage cheese",
    "12 ounces mild Cheddar cheese, shredded",
    "0.5 cup onion, shredded",
    "6 jumbo eggs"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Lightly grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Dp2lrtZK5lqj-8WO_pZJT2U7POQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24532-sausage-casserole-step-01-88638e185ed048139defb9581fa1af9e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24532/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a large, deep skillet over medium-high heat. Cook sausage in the hot skillet until evenly browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes. Drain and discard grease.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JXxOki4K7Od0SJm194OknH2rX6Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24532-sausage-casserole-step-02-fbb5a2c8109b44cc8a02cf0249f74ac1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24532/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir together shredded potatoes and butter in the prepared baking dish; lightly press mixture into the bottom and sides of the dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QfGx6_VQm-cYjRUrXWxEA6txkmc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24532-sausage-casserole-step-03-5b3ae7a34a5040e89c623cd565755749.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24532/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together sausage, cottage cheese, Cheddar cheese, onion, and eggs in a bowl. Pour over potato mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_KhRSVARrdcekvN_sa9AqmXzal4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24532-sausage-casserole-step-04-5f4c0718a25b40f78a345c3799dae034.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24532/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center of casserole comes out clean, about 1 hour. Let cool for 5 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EMkkG1AlGXWaRsEyfv-DfVRnT-g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/24532-sausage-casserole-step-05-79315247df1e4f66b2a2589d4f3d5eb9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24532/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
